    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The return G_t is everything an agent collects from step t on, with each later reward shrunk by gamma once per step of delay: G_t = r_t + gamma r_{t+1} + gamma^2 r_{t+2} + ... Written as a recursion, G_t = r_t + gamma G_{t+1}, so Discount computes it in one pass from the last step back to the first. The episode here is 10 steps long and pays a single reward of 1 at the last step, so G_t = gamma^(9 - t). The first step's return is 0.002 at gamma 0.5, 0.387 at gamma 0.9 and 0.914 at gamma 0.99: gamma sets how far back a reward still reaches. A task that pays only at the end, such as an LLM answer graded once it is finished, needs gamma close to 1.\n\n回報 G_t 是代理人從第 t 步開始拿到的全部獎勵，越晚拿到的獎勵每延後一步就再乘一次 gamma：G_t = r_t + gamma r_{t+1} + gamma^2 r_{t+2} + ...。寫成遞迴就是 G_t = r_t + gamma G_{t+1}，所以 Discount 從最後一步往回算，一次就算完。這裡的 episode 有 10 步，只在最後一步給 1 的獎勵，因此 G_t = gamma^(9 - t)。第一步的回報在 gamma 0.5 時是 0.002，gamma 0.9 時是 0.387，gamma 0.99 時是 0.914：gamma 決定一個獎勵能往回傳多遠。只在最後才給分的任務，例如回答寫完才評分的 LLM，需要接近 1 的 gamma。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-rewards",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 340
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The rewards, one per step: nine zeros and a 1. Edit the values, for example a -0.1 at each of the nine steps before the 1, and rerun: the step cost pulls the first return below zero at gamma 0.5 and 0.9, while at 0.99 the final reward still outweighs it.\n\n每一步一個獎勵：九個 0 和一個 1。改一下數值，例如在 1 之前的九步都放 -0.1，再執行一次：每步的成本讓 gamma 0.5 與 0.9 的第一步回報變成負的，gamma 0.99 時最後那個獎勵仍然比較大。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "rewards",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 340
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-plot",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1640,
        "y": 420
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Stack puts the gamma 0.5 and 0.9 returns into a [2, 10] tensor, Unsqueeze makes the gamma 0.99 returns [1, 10], and Concat joins them into [3, 10], which Visualize draws as three lines. Every line ends at 1 on the last step, where the reward is paid.\n\nStack 把 gamma 0.5 與 0.9 的回報合成 [2, 10] 的張量，Unsqueeze 把 gamma 0.99 的回報變成 [1, 10]，Concat 再把兩者接成 [3, 10]，Visualize 畫成三條線。每條線在最後一步都是 1，因為獎勵就在那一步給出。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "viz",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 420
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
